Subject: drm: SM7250 display, Samsung AMS644VK04 panel, Adreno 620

Combined diff of the following commits (base v7.3-rc7):

  - drm/msm/dpu: Add SM7250 (DPU 6.1.0) catalog, mdss and UBWC data
  - drm/panel: Add Samsung AMS644VK04 DSC command mode panel driver
  - drm/msm/adreno: add Adreno 620 (0x06020000) catalog entry
  - drm/msm/a6xx: add the a620 bandwidth table for the GMU
  - drm/msm/a6xx: program the PDC sequencer on a620
  - drm/msm/adreno: Add speedbins table for Adreno 620
  - HACK: drm/msm/dpu: msm.tc_sync_cfg_height debug override
  - Revert "HACK: drm/msm/dpu: msm.tc_sync_cfg_height debug override"

